paparazzi/models/update_first_order_low_pass/rocq/functional/problem/Spec.v
From Stdlib Require Import List ZArith Lia.
From compcert Require Import Coqlib Integers Floats AST Values Memory Memdata Csem Smallstep.
From FiveShared.verification Require Import Obligations.
From FiveLowpassUpdate Require Import Source Execution.
From FiveLowpassUpdateCase Require Import Contract UpdateCall.
From FiveGuidanceAllOrder Require Import PureSyntax CallfreeExecution.
From FiveLowpassSupport Require Import LowpassMemory Straightline.
Import ListNotations.
Local Open Scope Z_scope.
Definition NormalCompletion:Prop:=forall m b p tc li lo value,Initialized m b p tc li lo->exists t mf,
 star Csem.step Execution.ge(Execution.entry(Args b p value)m)t(Returnstate(Vsingle(output tc li lo value))Kstop mf) /\Post m mf b p tc li lo value.
Definition AllReturns:Prop:=forall m b p tc li lo value,Initialized m b p tc li lo->forall t result mf,
 star Csem.step Execution.ge(Execution.entry(Args b p value)m)t(Returnstate result Kstop mf)->result=Vsingle(output tc li lo value) /\Post m mf b p tc li lo value.

paparazzi/models/update_first_order_low_pass/rocq/execution_correspondence/problem/Spec.v
From Stdlib Require Import List ZArith.
From compcert Require Import AST Values Memory Events Ctypes Csyntax Csem Cexec Smallstep.
From FiveShared.verification Require Import Obligations.
From FiveLowpassUpdate Require Import Source Execution.
From FiveGuidanceSemantics Require Import SourceClosure.
From FiveLowpassUpdateExecutionCorrespondence Require Import Closure.
Import ListNotations.
Definition source_state := Closure.SS.
Definition closed_step := Closure.closed_step.
Definition domain_preservation_goal:Prop := forall args m,
 Execution.entry args m=Callstate(Internal Source.f_update_first_order_low_pass)args Kstop m /\ source_state(Execution.entry args m).
Definition reachable_step_goal:Prop := forall args m t reached tr next,
 star Csem.step Execution.ge(Execution.entry args m)t reached ->
 (closed_step tt reached tr next <-> Csem.step Execution.ge reached tr next).
Definition floating_point_correspondence_goal := reachable_step_goal.
Definition machine_integer_correspondence_goal := reachable_step_goal.
Definition memory_access_correspondence_goal := reachable_step_goal.
Definition control_and_exhaustion_correspondence_goal:Prop := forall args m t final,
 star closed_step tt(Execution.entry args m)t final <->
 star Csem.step Execution.ge(Execution.entry args m)t final.
Definition normal_result_and_memory_correspondence_goal:Prop := forall args m t v mf b ofs n,
 (star closed_step tt(Execution.entry args m)t(Returnstate v Kstop mf) <->
 star Csem.step Execution.ge(Execution.entry args m)t(Returnstate v Kstop mf)) /\
 Execution.observe_bytes mf b ofs n=Mem.loadbytes mf b ofs n.
Definition invalid_operation_correspondence_goal:Prop := forall args m t reached,
 star Csem.step Execution.ge(Execution.entry args m)t reached ->
 (Execution.source_error reached <-> ~Execution.normal_return reached /\ nostep closed_step tt reached).
Definition whole_execution_correspondence_goal := control_and_exhaustion_correspondence_goal.

paparazzi/models/update_first_order_low_pass/rocq/no_error/problem/Spec.v
From Stdlib Require Import List ZArith Lia.
From compcert Require Import Coqlib Integers Floats AST Values Memory Memdata Csem Smallstep.
From FiveShared.verification Require Import Obligations.
From FiveLowpassUpdate Require Import Source Execution.
From FiveLowpassUpdateCase Require Import Contract UpdateCall.
From FiveGuidanceAllOrder Require Import PureSyntax CallfreeExecution.
From FiveLowpassSupport Require Import LowpassMemory Straightline.
Import ListNotations.
Local Open Scope Z_scope.
Definition NoError:Prop:=forall args m,Precondition args m->no_error Execution.ge(Execution.entry args m).

paparazzi/models/update_first_order_low_pass/rocq/termination/problem/Spec.v
From compcert Require Import Values Memory.
From FiveShared.verification Require Import Obligations.
From FiveLowpassUpdate Require Import Execution.
Definition AllSuccessorsTerminate : Prop := forall args m,Acc(successor Execution.ge)(Execution.entry args m).

paparazzi/relations/lowpass_update_readback/problem/Spec.v
From Stdlib Require Import List ZArith.
From compcert Require Import Integers Floats AST Values Memory Memdata Events Csem Smallstep.
Require FiveLowpassUpdate.Execution FiveLowpassGet.Execution FiveLowpassGetCase.Contract FiveLowpassUpdateCase.Contract.
Import ListNotations.
Local Open Scope Z_scope.
Module U:=FiveLowpassUpdateCase.Contract.
Definition Update(m:mem)(b:block)(p:ptrofs)(input:float32)(t:trace)(result:val)(mu:mem):Prop:=
 star Csem.step FiveLowpassUpdate.Execution.ge(FiveLowpassUpdate.Execution.entry[Vptr b p;Vsingle input]m)t(Returnstate result Kstop mu).
Definition Get(mu:mem)(b:block)(p:ptrofs)(t:trace)(result:val)(mf:mem):Prop:=
 star Csem.step FiveLowpassGet.Execution.ge(FiveLowpassGet.Execution.entry[Vptr b p]mu)t(Returnstate result Kstop mf).
Definition Bits(v:val):option int:=match v with Vsingle f=>Some(Float32.to_bits f)|_=>None end.
Definition Observations(m mu mf:mem)(b:block)(p:ptrofs)(input:float32)(returned:val):Prop:=
 Mem.loadbytes mu b(Ptrofs.unsigned p)4=Mem.loadbytes m b(Ptrofs.unsigned p)4 /\
 Mem.loadbytes mf b(Ptrofs.unsigned p)4=Mem.loadbytes m b(Ptrofs.unsigned p)4 /\
 Mem.loadbytes mu b(Ptrofs.unsigned p+4)4=Some(encode_val Mfloat32(Vsingle input)) /\
 Mem.loadbytes mf b(Ptrofs.unsigned p+4)4=Some(encode_val Mfloat32(Vsingle input)) /\
 Mem.loadbytes mu b(Ptrofs.unsigned p+8)4=Some(encode_val Mfloat32 returned) /\
 Mem.loadbytes mf b(Ptrofs.unsigned p+8)4=Some(encode_val Mfloat32 returned) /\
 FiveLowpassGetCase.Contract.Frame mu mf /\ U.Frame m mu b p.
Definition NormalCompletion:Prop:=forall m b p tc li lo input,U.Initialized m b p tc li lo->
 exists tu mu tg mf,
 Update m b p input tu(Vsingle(U.output tc li lo input))mu /\
 Get mu b p tg(Vsingle(U.output tc li lo input))mf /\
 Observations m mu mf b p input(Vsingle(U.output tc li lo input)).
Definition AllReturns:Prop:=forall m b p tc li lo input,U.Initialized m b p tc li lo->
 forall tu r mu tg y mf,Update m b p input tu r mu->Get mu b p tg y mf->
 r=Vsingle(U.output tc li lo input) /\y=r /\Bits r=Bits y /\
 Observations m mu mf b p input r.

